{"ticker":"LDOS","updated":"2026-11-27T23:04:36Z","profile":{"longName":"Leidos Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"Leidos Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.leidos.com","fullTimeEmployees":50000,"marketCap":16076461056,"trailingPE":11.776587,"forwardPE":11.148598,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.90342575,"pegRatio":0.71,"targetMeanPrice":153.73334,"targetHighPrice":225.0,"targetLowPrice":120.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.036,"earningsGrowth":0.163,"grossMargins":0.17628999,"operatingMargins":0.1184,"profitMargins":0.07974,"totalRevenue":17795000320,"beta":0.544,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":205.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":98.86,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.32},"summary":"Leidos Holdings, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides services and solutions for government and commercial customers in the United States and internationally. The National Security & Digital segment provides national security software; services by using artificial intelligence and machine learning to coordinate sea, ground, air, and space to help warfighters; offensive, defensive, and physical cyber operation solutions; intelligence analysis, operational support, logistics operations, security, linguistics, force production, biometrics, chemical, biological, radiological, nuclear, and explosives, energetics, training, and other services; and Digital Modernization and transformation services. The Health & Civil segment offers air traffic control systems; health mission software; managed health services; infrastructure management and operation; logistical operations and information technology support; and life science research and development support services. The Commercial & International segment provides power grid engineering and design, grid modernization, utility planning and consulting, energy management and efficiency, technology-driven innovation, and software and application development; people scanners, computed tomography carry-on baggage scanners, checked baggage scanners, and explosive trace detectors; mobile, non-intrusive ports and borders inspection sys","summary_zh":"Leidos Holdings, Inc. 及其子公司為美國和國際上的政府和商業客戶提供服務和解決方案。國家安全與數位部門提供國家安全軟體；透過使用人工智慧和機器學習來協調海上、地面、空中和太空來幫助作戰人員提供服務；進攻性、防禦性和物理網路作戰解決方案；情報分析、作戰支援、後勤作戰、安全、語言學、部隊生產、生物識別、化學、生物、放射性、核子與爆炸物、能量學、培訓和其他服務；以及現代化轉型和其他服務；健康與民用部門提供空中交通管制系統；健康使命軟體；管理衛生服務；基礎設施管理和運營；後勤運作和資訊技術支援；和生命科學研究和開發支援服務。商業和國際部門提供電網工程和設計、電網現代化、公用事業規劃和諮詢、能源管理和效率、技術驅動的創新以及軟體和應用程序開發；人員掃描儀、電腦斷層掃描隨身行李掃描儀、托運行李掃描儀和爆炸物微量探測器；移動、非侵入式港口和邊境檢查系統","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"資訊科技服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":186.22,"h":187.5,"l":184.09,"c":185.61,"v":846900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":186.21,"h":189.74,"l":186.06,"c":188.96,"v":844400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":186.81,"h":191.66,"l":186.81,"c":191.63,"v":956000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":191.25,"h":193.64,"l":190.06,"c":192.89,"v":744800},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":192.81,"h":197.46,"l":192.0,"c":195.58,"v":868100},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":195.58,"h":198.81,"l":195.0,"c":198.04,"v":885400},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":198.95,"h":199.28,"l":196.39,"c":197.0,"v":669000},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":198.0,"h":198.56,"l":195.64,"c":198.23,"v":779800},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":198.18,"h":198.61,"l":193.85,"c":194.05,"v":674300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":194.47,"h":194.8,"l":187.82,"c":188.03,"v":763500},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":188.1,"h":188.38,"l":185.52,"c":185.94,"v":781000},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":185.17,"h":188.8,"l":184.31,"c":187.27,"v":512800},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":187.67,"h":189.28,"l":184.29,"c":186.57,"v":496000},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":186.14,"h":187.36,"l":183.99,"c":184.41,"v":628400},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":184.26,"h":185.76,"l":180.45,"c":184.51,"v":774800},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":186.28,"h":191.29,"l":185.1,"c":190.49,"v":536300},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":190.81,"h":193.72,"l":190.5,"c":193.16,"v":855500},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":192.62,"h":193.4,"l":188.0,"c":188.4